Notes on the hashes above:
- The four UI screenshots are static inputs produced by the site agent's smoke run.
- Every PlatformIO build embeds a fresh 32-bit build ID, so the .elf/.hex/.uf2/.bin
  bytes (and therefore their sha256) change on every rebuild even with identical
  source. The UF2/DFU hashes in section 7 belong to the image packaged in this run.
- adafruit-nrfutil embeds a timestamp in the DFU zip, so the .dfu.zip sha256 is not
  reproducible across runs from the same HEX. The verified fields that are stable
  are application_version 66048, DFU 0.5, device_type 0x52, sd_req 0xb6, the HEX
  bounds and firmware_sha256 over the .bin payload.
- Nothing was flashed, published, tagged or released; this log is local evidence only.

OVERALL: PASS (all 7 sections exited 0)
